  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Discord moderation flag\nIgnores bots, scores each message, and routes it: spam is flagged, abuse is flagged and escalated to you, everything else is left alone.\n\n**Setup:** add credentials to each node, replace every REPLACE_ME, test with one item, then activate.\n\n**Guardrails:** Flag-only. A human moderator takes every action. It never deletes or bans.\n\nA failed run alerts you. No secrets are stored in this file.",
    "height": 220,
